<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ABB.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ABB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of ABB AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 200 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,300 CHF		 PREMIUM	14.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.13 CHF		  GEARING	9.70 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.JUL.97-20.NOV.98   PAYDATE	27.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 200</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,185 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
